## 11. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE

The system must follow this architecture:

Layer 1 – User Interface:
React web application with role-specific dashboards.

Layer 2 – API Layer:
Flask REST APIs for authentication, reports, inventory, allocations, users and shipments.

Layer 3 – Business Logic:
- AI classification service.
- Duplicate detection service.
- Priority scoring service.
- TrustShield service.
- Resource optimisation service.
- Prediction service.
- Digital Twin service.
- Offline synchronisation service.

Layer 4 – Data Layer:
PostgreSQL and PostGIS.

Layer 5 – Real-time Communication:
Flask-SocketIO for relevant status updates and notifications.

Flow:

User → React Frontend → Flask API → Application Services → PostgreSQL/PostGIS → Response to Frontend.

